  <!-- Section 3: Architecture & Security -->
  <div class="info-box">
    <h3>3. Security & Control Flow Scoping</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Automatic Classroom Mapping:</strong> Upon logging in with Google on Web or Mobile, teachers are automatically filtered to their designated section.</li>
      <li><strong>Admin Privileges:</strong> Administrators have permission to view all 12 sections and 266 active student records.</li>
      <li><strong>Substitute Delegation Mode:</strong> Temporary teacher coverage can be assigned directly in Settings without code or schema changes.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
